    <string name="smart_formatting_helper">Adapts longer dictation to the active app: polished email paragraphs, bullets or numbered steps for real lists, concise messages, and structured notes.</string>
    <string name="never_use_clipboard_label">Never use the clipboard</string>
    <string name="never_use_clipboard_helper">Strict privacy mode. On Android 13+, Voicey writes through the active editor connection like a keyboard—no clipboard, including rich editors such as Gmail. Older incompatible editors show an error instead of using a temporary paste.</string>
